OL,3,GNEWSACalls for police to 'do better'
OL,4,Aenforcing 20mph limits
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe man in charge of Oxfordshire's
OL,7,Froads has called on police to "do
OL,8,Fbetter" in enforcing speed limits on
OL,9,F20mph zones introduced across the
OL,10,Fcounty in recent years.
OL,12,FSince 2022, Oxfordshire County Council
OL,13,Fhas introduced lower speed limits in
OL,14,F280 towns, villages and parishes as
OL,15,Fpart of a scheme initially expected to
OL,16,Fcost #8m.
OL,18,FGareth Epps, the council's transport
OL,19,Fchief, said the project had made the
OL,20,Fcounty's roads safer, but questioned
OL,21,Fthe level of enforcement by Thames
OL,22,FValley Police (TVP).
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
