OL,3,GNEWSACalls for police to 'do better'
OL,4,Aenforcing 20mph limits
OL,5,
OL,6,FResponding to the comments, the police
OL,7,Fforce said it "takes road safety
OL,8,Fseriously" and carries out enforcement
OL,9,Facross Oxfordshire "based on threat,
OL,10,Frisk, collision data and community
OL,11,Fconcerns".
